OL,4,BReferee being 'drunk' claims are       
OL,5,B'entirely unfounded'                   
OL,6,GClaims that a referee was drunk during 
OL,7,Gan Asian Football Confederation (AFC)  
OL,8,GChampions League Two match are         
OL,9,G"entirely unfounded", officials say.   
OL,11,FSyrian referee Hanna Hattab was        
OL,12,Freplaced at half-time of the match     
OL,13,Fbetween Iran's Gol Gohar and Al Jazira 
OL,14,Fof the United Arab Emirates.           
OL,16,FReports claimed Gol Gohar staff        
OL,17,Faccused the referee of being drunk     
OL,18,Ffollowing what has been described as   
OL,19,Fsome erratic decision-making in the    
OL,20,Ffirst half.                            
